# Company-proprietary survey data and its derivatives — never committed. Dataset/ and
# annotations/ are the delivered survey lines and everything derived from them (candidate
# boxes, diagnoses, picks). reference/hyperbolas/ is the two company deliverable sheets and
# their extracted crops — its own manifest.json names the client and site, so the whole
# directory is excluded, not just the images. reference/library.py and reference/__init__.py
# (code, not data) stay tracked.
Dataset/
annotations/
reference/hyperbolas/
